@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@userId = 1
@couponId = 1
@orderId = 1

### List coupon usages
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon-usages

### Filter usages by coupon
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon-usages?couponId={{couponId}}

### Get a coupon usage by its composite key
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon-usages/{{userId}}/{{couponId}}/{{orderId}}

### Record coupon usage
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupon-usages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "couponId": 1,
  "orderId": 1
}

### Remove coupon usage
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/coupon-usages/{{userId}}/{{couponId}}/{{orderId}}
